{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45456","headline":"经废宫 · 栖白","name":"经废宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终日河声咽暮空，烟愁此地昼蒙蒙。\n锦帆东去沙侵苑，玉辇西来树满宫。\n鲁客望津天欲雪，朔鸿离岸苇生风。\n那堪独立思前事，回首残阳雉堞红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"栖白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}